Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. 147 Easy Street was a typical semi-detached terrace home for Melbourne's inner city suburbs. Its front door opened to a narrow hallway with three bedrooms leading off to the right. A bathroom sat at the end of the hall which also doubled as the laundry. Another door led to a living room and modest kitchen which opened to a small backyard encased by a fence. From the yard, a gate granted access to a side laneway that separated number 147 from a neighbouring property and led out into the street.
我们的节目涉及严肃且往往令人痛苦的事件。如果您在任何时候感到需要支持，请联系您当地的危机中心。如需获取保密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您应用中或我们网站上本集的节目说明。147号Easy街是墨尔本内城区典型的半独立式排屋。前门通向一条狭窄的走廊，右侧有三间卧室。走廊尽头是一间浴室，同时也兼作洗衣房。另一扇门通向客厅和简朴的厨房，厨房通向一个被栅栏围住的小后院。从院子里，一扇门可以通往一条侧巷，这条巷子将147号与邻近的房产隔开，并通向街道。

