00:04:15.000 --> 00:05:16.000
Alona met him outside and led him into 147's backyard via the side laneway along the same route she had taken almost half an hour earlier. Mischka's vacant kennel sat under the kitchen window near the open back door. The officer stepped inside into the narrow kitchen with its bric-a-brac filled shelves and onwards to the living room. So far, nothing seemed out of the ordinary. There was a couch, television and record player. Everything appeared neat and in order. The officer reached the dimly lit hallway and peered towards the front door. At the end of the hall, lying face down next to the door was the bloodied body of Susan Bartlett. She was fully clothed in a nightdress with numerous stab wounds to her arms, hands, legs and upper torso.
阿洛娜在外面迎接他，并带着他沿着半小时前走过的路线，经由侧巷进入147号的后院。米什卡空荡荡的狗窝就在敞开的后门旁边的厨房窗户下。警官走进狭窄的厨房，里面摆满了杂物架，随后进入客厅。到目前为止，一切似乎都很正常。屋里有沙发、电视和唱片机。一切看起来整洁有序。警官走到光线昏暗的走廊，向大门方向望去。在走廊尽头，脸朝下倒在门边的是苏珊·巴特利特血迹斑斑的尸体。她穿着睡衣，手臂、手部、腿部和上半身有多处刀伤。

